      "key": "05dfc833-9251-40d3-a491-ebdfb54f5b7a",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "5477c23b-3bd4-41e1-84a1-c2023939ccd2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "296af3fb-48b0-4ad6-b725-1e6376a7b926",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 4* Doubletree by Hilton Westerwood Hotel in Cumbernauld near Glasgow. Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and indoor swimming pool. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "c9158539-727a-473b-965d-0458198b979c",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGlasgow\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERoyal Yacht Britannia\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEdinburgh\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELoch Lomond\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETarbet\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHill House\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFalkirk Wheel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKelvingrove Art Gallery \u0026amp; Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "0e911c05-6fda-49a1-a447-ffb382316d44",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EStirling Castle - built between 1370 and 1750, the Castle has been besieged or attacked at least 16 times\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScone Palace - once the crowning place of the Kings of Scots, the home to the Earl of Mansfield is revered as the historic jewel in the crown of Scotland\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETour \u0026amp; tasting at Deanston Distillery - a cotton mill for 180 years, Deanston was transformed into a whisky distillery in the 1960\u2019s and has been using traditional methods ever since\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESt Mungo\u2019s Cathedral - on the site where St Mungo, the first bishop of Strathclyde, was buried in AD 612, the present cathedral dates from the 13th century and is the only one on the Scottish mainland to have survived complete the 1560 Reformation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalace of Holyroodhouse, Edinburgh - the Queen\u2019s official residence in Scotland and the Queen\u2019s Gallery, built in the shell of the former Holyroodhouse Free Church and Duchess of Gordon\u2019s School\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHopetoun House - set in 150 acres of rolling parkland and one of the most splendid examples of the work of Scottish architects Sir William Bruce, William Adam and his sons John and Robert\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "ac288bd8-a4d9-4bc9-9154-7818f67c7825",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Cumbernauld\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 with comfort stops en route to Scotland \u2013 continue to the 4* Doubletree by Hilton Westerwood Hotel in Cumbernauld near Glasgow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Royal Yacht Britannia \u0026amp; Edinburgh\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EServing the Royal Family for over forty years, the Royal Yacht played a leading role in some of the defining moments of recent history and the audio tour takes in the State Dining Room, the Bridge and the Queen\u2019s Sitting Room \u2013 free time in central Edinburgh to visit Holyrood House, the world famous Princess Street, the Castle or the National Gallery of Scotland.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Loch Lomond, Tarbet \u0026amp; Hill House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis morning there is an optional short cruise on Loch Lomond \u2013 lunch in the picturesque village of Tarbet \u2013 Charles Rennie Mackintosh\u0026#39;s Hill House in Helensburgh sits high above the Clyde and the feel is of restrained elegance combined with dazzling architecture.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Falkirk Wheel, Kelvingrove Art Gallery \u0026amp; Museum and Glasgow\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Falkirk Wheel is the world\u0026#39;s first and only rotating boatlift \u2013 Kelvingrove Art Gallery and Museum in Glasgow, Scotland\u2019s most visited museum, is home to one of Europe\u2019s greatest civic art collections \u2013 free time in Glasgow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStop at a carefully selected National Trust property determined by your location \u2013 travel on to the original designated pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
